From: Orca Glass <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:57:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(appearance): add Glass interface setting

Turns the sidebars, tab strips, title bar and status bar into tinted glass
over the window material or theme image, so the whole window reads as one
translucent surface instead of only the terminals. Tokens are re-declared on
#root so the editor theme, plugin frames, menus and dialogs keep the opaque
palette. Tint follows Background opacity; off under Reduce Visual Effects.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
